{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Otto is a sea otter in the ocean. Sea otters are mammals, and they breathe air and care for their babies.","words":[[0,0.35],[0.45,0.58],[0.64,0.69],[0.82,1.15],[1.23,1.63],[1.71,1.81],[1.86,1.95],[2.03,2.58],[2.96,3.2],[3.26,3.66],[3.73,3.91],[3.98,4.64],[4.85,5.06],[5.12,5.26],[5.35,5.76],[5.85,6.19],[6.27,6.42],[6.56,6.99],[7.06,7.21],[7.27,7.48],[7.55,8.5]]},{"text":"The water can be cold. Otto stays warm with thick fur that traps air and keeps his body cozy.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.27,0.6],[0.66,0.81],[0.87,0.97],[1.04,1.6],[1.99,2.29],[2.36,2.71],[2.79,3.12],[3.19,3.39],[3.45,3.69],[3.79,4.08],[4.16,4.32],[4.37,4.77],[4.84,5.11],[5.19,5.35],[5.43,5.72],[5.77,5.91],[5.98,6.28],[6.36,7.29]]},{"text":"Otto floats on his back like a little boat. Floating helps him rest and eat without sinking.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.38,0.78],[0.84,0.94],[1,1.11],[1.2,1.45],[1.53,1.74],[1.79,1.81],[1.88,2.19],[2.25,2.79],[3.17,3.65],[3.71,4.02],[4.08,4.19],[4.3,4.59],[4.66,4.77],[4.88,5.11],[5.18,5.58],[5.65,6.59]]},{"text":"Otto loves crunchy snacks like clams and sea urchins. He holds food on his tummy like a tiny table.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.43,0.76],[0.84,1.3],[1.37,1.83],[1.89,2.1],[2.17,2.69],[2.75,2.91],[3.02,3.32],[3.39,4.19],[4.71,4.85],[4.93,5.27],[5.38,5.72],[5.78,5.89],[5.96,6.11],[6.19,6.58],[6.65,6.86],[6.88,6.93],[7,7.41],[7.49,8.41]]},{"text":"Sometimes Otto uses a rock as a tool. He taps the shell on the rock to open it.","words":[[0,0.64],[0.72,0.96],[1.04,1.35],[1.42,1.46],[1.56,1.81],[1.88,1.99],[2.04,2.09],[2.17,2.69],[3.02,3.15],[3.22,3.52],[3.54,3.61],[3.67,3.96],[4.04,4.13],[4.18,4.25],[4.32,4.57],[4.64,4.74],[4.83,5.18],[5.25,5.85]]},{"text":"Using tools is smart. Otto’s rock helps him get food that would be hard to open with paws alone.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.43,0.81],[0.87,0.99],[1.06,1.8],[2.01,2.4],[2.51,2.81],[2.89,3.22],[3.26,3.38],[3.46,3.66],[3.8,4.16],[4.21,4.39],[4.46,4.69],[4.75,4.87],[4.95,5.26],[5.31,5.38],[5.48,5.82],[5.88,6.07],[6.15,6.51],[6.58,7.52]]},{"text":"Otto sometimes wraps in kelp. Kelp is a sea plant, and it can help Otto stay in one spot while resting.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.41,0.96],[1.01,1.37],[1.42,1.51],[1.6,2.17],[2.5,2.8],[2.87,2.96],[3.02,3.06],[3.15,3.37],[3.44,3.96],[4.02,4.2],[4.27,4.34],[4.39,4.56],[4.66,4.95],[5.04,5.32],[5.4,5.69],[5.75,5.82],[5.96,6.21],[6.26,6.69],[6.75,7.02],[7.08,8.03]]},{"text":"Otto must breathe air, so he lifts his nose above water. Then he relaxes and floats again.","words":[[0,0.33],[0.41,0.64],[0.71,1.08],[1.16,1.63],[1.76,1.92],[2,2.07],[2.15,2.46],[2.52,2.67],[2.75,3.08],[3.12,3.46],[3.53,4.16],[4.48,4.7],[4.76,4.83],[4.92,5.58],[5.65,5.79],[5.88,6.28],[6.34,7.11]]},{"text":"Otto’s fur stays clean because he grooms it. Clean fur traps air better and keeps him warmer in cold water.","words":[[0,0.44],[0.55,0.81],[0.89,1.23],[1.31,1.66],[1.74,2.1],[2.13,2.19],[2.28,2.73],[2.8,3.13],[3.52,3.84],[3.98,4.24],[4.33,4.79],[4.89,5.18],[5.32,5.76],[5.86,6.12],[6.21,6.51],[6.56,6.69],[6.78,7.23],[7.31,7.42],[7.56,7.94],[8.02,8.87]]},{"text":"Otto smiles at the sunset. He remembers: thick fur keeps him warm, and a rock tool helps him eat.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.41,0.92],[0.97,1.08],[1.13,1.2],[1.24,2.04],[2.33,2.47],[2.55,3.41],[3.7,3.99],[4.09,4.39],[4.53,4.84],[4.89,5.03],[5.11,5.72],[5.97,6.15],[6.22,6.25],[6.33,6.59],[6.68,7.02],[7.13,7.45],[7.51,7.66],[7.74,8.45]]}]}